---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import waveSkyImage from '@/assets/images/home/wave_sky_image.webp';
---

<section class="bg-surface-primary py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-36">
  <div class="page-container flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
    <div class="reveal max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-2xl leading-snug font-bold tracking-tight text-content-primary sm:text-4xl sm:leading-snug lg:text-5xl lg:leading-tight">
        데이터를 기술로,<br class="hidden sm:inline" /> 기술을 더 나은 판단으로.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-12 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl sm:mt-16 lg:mt-20">
      <div class="relative aspect-video max-h-140 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-surface-subtle shadow-xs sm:aspect-21/9 lg:aspect-24/9">
        <Image
          src={waveSkyImage}
          alt="KOAST 해양·기상 기술"
          loading="lazy"
          class="size-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-105"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
